why A rare off-hand orb or staff for your 20s, for fragments from two dungeons.

# The Orb of Soran'ruk (1740): Doan Karhan in the Barrens wants three Soran'ruk
# Fragments from the Twilight Acolytes in Blackfathom Deeps and a Large
# Soran'ruk Fragment from the Shadowfang Darksouls in Shadowfang Keep, and
# lets you choose the Orb of Soran'ruk (off-hand) or the Staff of Soran'ruk.
# Both sides can take it: Doan Karhan is friendly to both.
# Drops (items.json): every Twilight Acolyte (24-25, elite) drops a fragment;
# a Darksoul (21, elite) drops the large one one time in five, so a Shadowfang
# run may not be enough. Both are dungeon mobs: groups of five.
# Neither reference class guide carries this quest; ours routes it whole.
# Sources: Forever's quest data (quests.json, npcs.json, items.json) for Doan
# Karhan, the drops and the rewards (level 25, needs 20, 2550 experience);
# Forever's dungeon entrances (dungeons.json) for the two doors; the quest
# notes (data/local/mechanics) for where the mobs stand inside.

step Doan Karhan
  tip Doan Karhan camps beside Takar the Seer, at a tent just north-east of Camp Taurajo in the southern Barrens. Alliance warlocks reach him from Ratchet or Theramore; Horde ones ride south from the Crossroads. He wants fragments from two dungeons: take the quest before your Blackfathom Deeps and Shadowfang Keep runs.
  level 20
  accept 1740                         -- Doan Karhan

step Blackfathom Deeps
  zone Ashenvale
  tip Blackfathom Deeps (level 24-32, a group of five) opens in the ruins on the north-west coast of Ashenvale, under the water at Zoram Strand. The Twilight Acolytes (level 24-25, elite, healers) stand in the last halls, around Twilight Lord Kelris and the altar before Aku'mai; each one drops a fragment, but only three spawn in a run and they do not come back for two hours, so one run covers one warlock: kill them first, before they heal the rest.
  collect 6914 x3 quest 1740.1 @14.5,14.2 live -- Soran'ruk Fragments, from the Twilight Acolytes inside

step Shadowfang Keep
  zone Silverpine Forest
  tip Shadowfang Keep (level 22-30, a group of five) stands on the hill south of the Sepulcher. Free the prisoner in the cells right of the entrance and he opens the way into the courtyard. The Shadowfang Darksouls (level 20-21, elite) are not in the courtyard: they walk the halls past it, up the ramp that curves left and in the building after. About twelve stand in a run and one in five drops the Large Fragment, so clear every Darksoul and run it again if it does not drop.
  collect 6915 quest 1740.2 @44.8,67.8 live -- Large Soran'ruk Fragment, from the Shadowfang Darksouls inside

step Back to Doan Karhan
  zone The Barrens
  tip Choose the off-hand Orb of Soran'ruk or the two-handed Staff of Soran'ruk.
  turnin 1740 choose 6898 15109       -- Doan Karhan
